 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "NAPOLI1997"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "NAPOLI 1997 (ナポリ 1997) is a fan spin-off based on the manga Jojo`s Bizarre Adventure, NAPOLI 1997 tells the story of an agent of the mysterious organization \"Speedwagon Foundation\" named - Marlin Johnson, who is sent to sunny Naples in search of a missing person, an agent of the same organization - Jean Pierre Pollnaref. A young bounty hunter, Cacciatore di Taglie, comes to help Merlin. Together they set off on a journey in search of Pollnaref. Thanks to one of the enemies they met, they learned about the strong connection between the incident of Jean's disappearance and the \"Passione\" mafia organization. Will they be able to find the missing agent, will they be able to go through this long and difficult path...?"
  },
